  "description": "Create a real-photo travel editorial hero from the office desk image.",
  "instruction": "Create an 800x600 travel editorial hero from the real office desk photo. Complete it as a production workflow: place and crop the photo, apply the final color treatment, add the main information panel, add the accent strip, add the approval badge, add the headline 'TRAVEL PICK 013', add the detail 'WEEKEND GUIDE 013', add the owner/status line 'OWNER: EDITOR', and add the CTA 'PUBLISH HERO'.",
